{"id":"f67456d74b418241","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","title":"Linear Map","display":"df-linear-map — Linear Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-linear-map","aliases":["58-df-linear-map","Linear Map","Linear Transformation"],"display":"df-linear-map — Linear Map","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-linear-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-linear-map</span><span>Linear Map</span><span>Linear Transformation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-linear-map — Linear Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,V,W,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\">\\(T,V,W,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\)</span> (structure data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (fully explicit linear-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_k\\)</span> (designated-structure compatibility notation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,W,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,k,+_W,\\odot_W,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,V,W)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall v,w\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in k\\;\\Bigl[\nT\\!\\left(+_V\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\odot_V(\\langle\\alpha,v\\rangle),\\odot_V(\\langle\\beta,w\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}={+_W}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\odot_W(\\langle\\alpha,T(v)\\rangle),\\odot_W(\\langle\\beta,T(w)\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr]\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,W,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,k,+_W,\\odot_W,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,V,W)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall v,w\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in k\\;\\Bigl[\nT\\!\\left(+_V\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\odot_V(\\langle\\alpha,v\\rangle),\\odot_V(\\langle\\beta,w\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}={+_W}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\odot_W(\\langle\\alpha,T(v)\\rangle),\\odot_W(\\langle\\beta,T(w)\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr]\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}map\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Linear}_k(T;V,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,W,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}map\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Linear}_k(T;V,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,W,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Linear: preserves the designated addition and scalar multiplication on both spaces.</li>\n<li>两个向量空间共享同一组显式域运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\">\\(+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\)</span>；分别调用隐式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k\\)</span> 会允许在同一载集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 上选择不相容的域结构。</li>\n<li>核与像是依赖线性映射的独立定义；秩–零度公式是有限维情形的定理，不应混入本 assertion。</li>\n<li>Matrix representation: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\leftrightarrow A \\in M_{m\\times n}(k)\">\\(T \\leftrightarrow A \\in M_{m\\times n}(k)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Axler, Linear Algebra Done Right</li>\n<li>Roman, Advanced Linear Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../